{"2860870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MonoRace", "steam_appid": 2860870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MonoRace</strong> is a cheerful electric unicycle racing where you can explore tracks and get points by performing tricks. Try the game in VR and PC versions with unique controls.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monobikes is an electric, self-balancing unicycles, and you need to lean your body to control them. We have transferred this control mechanism to the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In VR game lean forward to accelerate, lean back to brake and lean left or right to turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In PC version move a mouse to control your unicycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will be a lot of tracks available and there will be several race paths on each of them. You can ride the main path or you can take a short cut.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get benefits by collecting bonuses.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform mortal tricks to get points and survive to the end without fail.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the quickest, or all your tricks point will be lost.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In training mode, you can try our unique control system and practice tricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860870/extras/253549f55c495c29aa5665f18a794745.avif?t=1764635266\" width=600 height=151 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MonoRace</strong> is a cheerful electric unicycle racing where you can explore tracks and get points by performing tricks. Try the game in VR and PC versions with unique controls.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monobikes is an electric, self-balancing unicycles, and you need to lean your body to control them. We have transferred this control mechanism to the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In VR game lean forward to accelerate, lean back to brake and lean left or right to turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In PC version move a mouse to control your unicycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will be a lot of tracks available and there will be several race paths on each of them. You can ride the main path or you can take a short cut.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get benefits by collecting bonuses.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform mortal tricks to get points and survive to the end without fail.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the quickest, or all your tricks point will be lost.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In training mode, you can try our unique control system and practice tricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860870/extras/253549f55c495c29aa5665f18a794745.avif?t=1764635266\" width=600 height=151 /></span></p>", "short_description": "MonoRace is a cheerful electric unicycle racing where you can explore tracks and get points by performing tricks. Try the game in VR and PC versions with unique controls.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, Italian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea